{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"delete\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"why\": \"它把 S01-1 的靠近渴望和 S01-2 的收敛顾虑重新概括了一遍。甜蜜与不敢多露出的状态，前两条已经能够让读者明白；谨慎开口的珠子也已有 S01-2 提供情境。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"why\": \"它重复了 S02-4 已经表达的心理动作：眼下明明还好好的，却因为知道美好终会过去而提前酸楚。S04-1 和 S04-3 已交代亲近仍在、想留住这份亲近，S02-4 也已经提供了相近的情境原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"why\": \"它再次表达 S02-4 已经出现过的预先不舍：知道美好的一刻留不住，因此尚未失去便先感到酸楚。这里没有进一步的决定或看法变化，S07-1、S07-2 已交代当下亲密的珍贵，S02-4 也已提供相近的情境原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8927392a-ffb2-46c8-ba58-be1d62a95169", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T063314622409Z", "elapsed_seconds": 371.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T06:39:26.289177+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d9d569a0e2987980783ca5c0942a75cc11e591f07ebcf437fde108563858fe34", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee